    (k) Looking Commands                (jcommdesc.txt#Looking)
    (l) Message Commands                (jcommdesc.txt#Message)
    (m) Game Status Commands            (jcommdesc.txt#GameStatus)
    (n) Saving and Exiting Commands     (jcommdesc.txt#SaveExit)
    (o) User Preference Commands        (jcommdesc.txt#UserPref)
